      "section": "verse"
    },
    {
      "text": "Z is for Zebra \ud83e\udd93 \u2014 stripes go by!",
      "inSeconds": 153.1,
      "outSeconds": 157.46,
      "section": "verse"
    },
    {
      "text": "We met them all, from A to Z \u2014",
      "inSeconds": 157.46,
      "outSeconds": 161.82,
      "section": "verse"
    },
    {
      "text": "Give yourself a clap, you and me!",
      "inSeconds": 161.82,
      "outSeconds": 165.21,
      "section": "verse"
    },
    {
      "text": "A B C D E F G \u2014 all the animals, can't you see?",
      "inSeconds": 165.21,
